## Frontend Sample — Publish

```typescript
type TestKafkaResponse = { eventId: string; referenceId: string };

const response = await api.post<TestKafkaResponse>(
  '/charging/test/kafka/publish',
  { message: 'hello' },
  { headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' } }
);

